 $ k215PReach (k215PState k215PNum2438 (k215PVector u t w c a b 0 0 v)) (k215PState k215PNum2464 (k215PVector u a (t, w) c a b 0 0 v)) $ = '(ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215PushAStage0At2438) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215PushAStage1At2438) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215PushAStage2At2438) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215PushAStage3At2438) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215PushAStage4At2438) k215PushAStage5At2438)))));

